lized consultation and site evaluation to understand your vision and outdoor space. Our team develops a complete 3D design to visualize the project and ensure every element works together seamlessly before construction begins.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-w-tab=\"Step 2\" class=\"w-tab-pane\"><div class=\"process-step\"><div class=\"content-step-tab\"><div class=\"wrapper-vertical-text\"><h2>2. Permits &amp; Site Preparation</h2><div class=\"text-divider\"><p>We handle all engineering, permits, and approvals required in Florida. Once approved, we prepare the site with proper excavation, structural framing, and foundational work to ensure long-term durability and safety.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"image-step-tab\"><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/images/site/outdoor-living-permits-site-preparation-florida-1-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/outdoor-living-permits-site-preparation-florida-1-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/outdoor-living-permits-site-preparation-florida-1-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/outdoor-living-permits-site-preparation-florida-1outdoor-living-permits-site-preparation-florida.webp 1250w\" alt=\"Final inspection of a newly completed swimming pool at a modern multifamily home in Florida\" src=\"/images/site/outdoor-living-permits-site-preparation-florida-1outdoor-living-permits-site-preparation-florida.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-process\"></div></div></div><div data-w-tab=\"Step 3\" class=\"w-tab-pane\"><div class=\"process-step\"><div class=\"image-step-tab\"><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/images/site/outdoor-living-construction-finishes-florida-1-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/outdoor-living-construction-finishes-florida-1-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/outdoor-living-construction-finishes-florida-1-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/outdoor-living-construction-finishes-florida-1outdoor-living-construction-finishes-florida.webp 1250w\" alt=\"Pool remodeling site preparation with excavation and foundation work at a modern residential property in Florida\" src=\"/images/site/outdoor-living-construction-finishes-florida-1outdoor-living-construction-finishes-florida.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-process\"></div><div class=\"content-step-tab\"><div class=\"wrapper-vertical-text\"><h2>3. Construction &amp; Finishes</h2><div class=\"text-divider\"><p>Our team completes all structural and installation work with precision, followed by high-quality finishes and materials. From integrated features to equipment, electrical, and safety requirements, every detail is built to meet the highest standards.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-w-tab=\"Step 4\" class=\"w-tab-pane\"><div class=\"process-step\"><div class=\"content-step-tab\"><div class=\"wrapper-vertical-text\"><h2>4. Final Inspection &amp; Handover</h2><div class=\"text-divider\"><p>We complete the project with a detailed inspection and walkthrough, ensuring everything meets our quality, safety, and craftsmanship standards. Once approved, your outdoor space is ready to enjoy with confidence and peace of mind.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"image-step-tab\"><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/images/site/outdoor-living-final-inspection-handover-florida-1-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/outdoor-living-final-inspection-handover-florida-1-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/outdoor-living-final-inspection-handover-florida-1-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/outdoor-living-final-inspection-handover-florida.webp 1250w\" alt=\"Completed outdoor living project featuring a modern pool, pergola, and tropical landscaping in Florida\" src=\"/images/site/outdoor-living-final-inspection-handover-florida.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-process\"></div></div></div></div></div></div><img src=\"/images/site/design3.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1919px) 100vw, 1920px\" srcset=\"/images/site/design3-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/design3-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/design3-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/design3-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/site/